{
  "id": "JHN.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 9",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap siida siji nea ng'oaw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha ghang'ata ak ghwadaah siisi ghayi siji nea ng'oaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghoanyaash ginealangaaschi niny nea gwayeesha, “Rabi, gwasin ng'eaha riing'eeda, gwasin siisi ghana sin ghwaan ea ghaamwat inyas geeji nea ng'oawiini?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Mii gideaba nisin siisi riing'eeda gil, ghana ghwaan ea ghaamwat, geebaysiina ghwadaajiit gadiyoojiga ASEETA aba niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gammiisa eesina gadiyoojiga siida ajeaknean, iidu ea askweari; ghwahidu eaweeda, ak ea mayghoamu siida gagadiiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiji duu dandeewa jeeda ng'eanyiidean, aniini geawooschi weeshinda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiit baloaldaanyi gwasin sheang'weeda aba ng'usheega ak ghwayeasha gheanyangeaba siidida ng'oawiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha niny, “Una ak giihuuni gheanyangaagu aba jeeda dabascheanda Siloamu” (nea gideaba dea siicheakta). Ng'ata gawa Siidida giihuushi ama ng'ata gabiigu nea niing'wearda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi fuga ascheayi sea fuga eawoojisu nidaah siidida aba mwadi nea gamusiisachiini, gwayi, “Neada siisi ea mii siidida apteadayi nea gamusiisachiini?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi mwaatkwa, “Ninyi”; nea mwaatkwa gwayi, “Manda, geaghus gideaba gawuurji sea niny.” Gwayeesha, “Siida aniini gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha, “Ghwajaadataan gheanyangaagu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha niny nea gwayeesha, “Gwasin siidida siguura Yesuhiin sheang'weeda ak ghwayeasha gheanyangeasu amahit gwayeeshiinean, ‘Una akgiihuushi aba Siloamu’; ng'ata geawi ak geahuunyi gheanyangeasu amahit ghaang'weardi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha, “Niny ghamneawa gwanda yeenu?” Hean gwayeesha siidida, “Aniini mwaanali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Farisaayajeega gwasikteawa gissihaapta siida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geayaat siidida ghayi ng'oawiin heeda Farisaayajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda eaweecheandida sina Yesu sheang'weeda ak ghwayeasha gheanyanga siida ak ghwajaada nea eaweeda Sabaatohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoanyaash Farisaayajeega gicha siidida ginyasta giing'weerdeayda?” Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha saawa, “Ghwayeasha gheanyangeasu sheang'weeda ama ng'ata geahuunyi ak ghaang'weardi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi Farisaayajeega mwaatkwa, “Siisi maleapna heeda ASEETA aba gideaba moang'waanya Sabaato.” Nea mwaatkwa gwayi, “Gayghoamuustaan siida riing'eeda gwasin gwadeagooda sunu?” Hean ghwadarda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geebiikta gicha eenyaash siidida ng'oawiin, “Asi ghamneawa siisi iinijaat gheanyangaagu giyeaniin ang'iing'i aba badaydeaba siisi?” Gwayeesha, “Siisi sibaneeda gil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea mamwasa fuga Yahudi gideaba siidida ghayi ea ng'oaw ak ghamneawa ea niing'wearda, ea eeyi bwak ea gaguursa ghwaan ea ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geanyaash ghwaan nea geeyeesha, “Nih baleandeang'wa ooyeenyi ghayi geeji nea ng'oawi? Ak ghamneawa ghwanyastaan giing'weerdeayda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Ghwaan ea ghaamwat ak gwayeesha, “Aseasa geanali gideaba nih baleandeanya gil, ea gideaba geeji nea ng'oaw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ginyasta giing'weerdeayda aseasa ea meanali, ak geabwadi nih eara siidida jaat gheanyangaaschiin ea meanali. Oanyaasha niny aba gideaba siida niheedu gil ghoamu gwarugu niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarukuteaydunu ghwaan ea ghaamwat aba gheawalmeeda fuga Yahudi aba gideaba fuga Yahudi niheeleesa gideaba siida wassean jea gwarugu aba ghuutaanyi gideaba Yesu niny Gristohi gajeeruuteawa jeeda ghooriida siinealshacheewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoah gidarukuteawa ghwaan ea ghaamwat gideaba, “Niny siida niheedu gil oanyaasha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta deaba iyeenya gaguursa siidida ghayi ng'oawiin ak gwayeesha, “Duumsheesiina ASEETA; aseasa geanali gideaba siisi gaba riing'a.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Siisi iibea riing'a aniini ea mwaanali, ak ghaanali aniini ng'asheanjagi nea gideaba ghayi geawooschi ng'oaw ak ghamneawa ea naang'weardi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha niny, “Gwahindaneeyiin? Ghwajaataan gheanyangaagu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha saawa, “Nigeawiit darukuneegwa ak ea mooleeysiini iit, ghwasaan anda googasayi ayiinya gicha? Eara agooga googasayi ahuwa ginealangaaschi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeng'eawi nea geeyeesha, “Ang'iing'i guwoosi giinealaneadaanyi ak aseasa geawooschi giinealanga Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa geanali gideaba ASEETA ghayi goobalool Musa amaduuku siisi ghanyea meanali eara heeleabu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha siidida, “Ng'asheanji ghwanung' ghaham fih ng'eanyi! Agooga moanali heeleabu ak ea nijaat gheanyangeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geanali gideaba ASEETA mooleeysiina iit fuga riing'eega, nea siida ii dea gadoowani ASEETA nea gwasin gidida bwariiy ninyiin, gaygooleeysiit ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada dea sibwada ng'eanyiida miyeeyiinya siida jaat gheanyanga siida ghayi siji nea ng'oaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siisi iimaleapna heeda ASEETA ea mayghoamu gwasin eara gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Saawa ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i geejiilseey jeeda riing'eeda haw ak gajanaaleasa?” Hean geeruuta jarooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'oowunda guroorooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiiy Yesu gideaba siiruuta jarooda niny, hean iidu nea ghwadaah gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i gimwasi Orjeeda Siida?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha ak gwayeesha, “Siida Mureeda, ng'eaha gil, ak abeeda gaydamwas niny?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Nidaahi niny, ak ea siisi abaloolnyiin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida, Naamwaschi”; ak ghaghadoawan niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu, “Aniini ghaawunyi badayda ng'eanyiida aba girgweaksiinda ak abeeda fuga moang'wearda gayghoang'wearda nea gang'oowiidi fuga ghamneawa ang'wearda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayiing'shi fuga mwaatkwa bea Farisaayajeega ghwanyawa neeki ng'asheegiga ak ghoanyaash gideaba, “Eara aseasa geawooschi ng'oowi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Ghwanyawa iyoowooschi ng'oowi ea majandeawana giidiinyeanda, ak ghamneawa gooyeenyi agooga, ‘Aseasa geang'weardi,’ abeeda giidiinyeanyeekeagwa gudugwanda heeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
